{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20468","headline":"和左司元郎中秋居十首 九 · 张籍","name":"和左司元郎中秋居十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林下无拘束，闲行放性灵。\n好时开药竈，高处置琴亭。\n更撰居山记，唯寻相鹤经。\n初当授衣假，无吏挽门铃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}